Upstream: https://gitlab.com/yolocam-linux/yolocam-linux
Protocol/library reference revision: f1cae5198fc4e709bc1a57b771974e333df27928

The protocol schema and control behavior were adapted from that project,
including local corrections verified against the YoloCam S3 firmware.
The native firmware updater and new firmware controls were first implemented
locally in the Python tools and are ported into this application.

The application contains no proprietary YoloLiv Compose binaries, camera
firmware images, device backups, captured camera pictures, or account secrets.
Official firmware packages are fetched from the manufacturer's service on
request and stay in the user's local cache.

